      "Language": "ukr",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "There has been a significant increase in diabetes morbidity in the past years. Prolonged asymptomatic progression of disease presents a problem and leads to late diagnosis and development of complications. Present study shows efficiency of screening measures to determine actual spread of carbohydrate metabolism disorders among residents of Odessa, frequency of type 2 diabetes mellitus risk factors determination and prevention of complications."},
